[0.016, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\r\u001b[33A\u001b[K\r\n  The out-of-tree Apache NuttX application and custom Seeed Studio XIAO RP2350 board configuration have been\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[?5W\u001b[J  implemented in \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk907b174d57601516;file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-vanilla/xiao-rp2350-bargraph/README.md\u0007xiao-rp2350-bargraph/\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007.\r\n\n  \u001b[1m### Breadboard Pinout (Seeed Studio XIAO RP2350)\u001b[m\r\n\n  All 6 bar-graph LEDs are placed on non-ADC digital pins (\u001b[94mD3\u001b[m–\u001b[94mD8\u001b[m) because \u001b[94mrp23xx_adc.c\u001b[m resets \u001b[94mGPIO26\u001b[m–\u001b[94mGPIO29\u001b[m (\u001b[94mD0\u001b[m–\u001b[94mD2\u001b[m)\r\n  to analog mode (\u001b[94mRP23XX_GPIO_FUNC_NULL\u001b[m) when initializing the ADC peripheral:\r\n\n   Function\u001b[19X\u001b[19C│ XIAO Pad  │ RP2350 GPIO   │ Active Polarity / Notes\r\n  ────────────────────────────┼───────────┼───────────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────"]
[0.0, "o", "───────────────\r\n   \u001b[1mPotentiometer Wiper\u001b[m \u001b[7b│ \u001b[1mD0 / A0\u001b[m   │ \u001b[94mGPIO26\u001b[m (\u001b[94mADC0\u001b[m) │ \u001b[94m0 V\u001b[m (\u001b[94mGND\u001b[m) to \u001b[94m3.3 V\u001b[m (\u001b[94m3V3\u001b[m), read via \u001b[94m/dev/adc0\u001b[m\r\n   \u001b[1mBar LED 1\u001b[m (lowest, ≥ 14%)  │ \u001b[1mD3\u001b[m \u001b[7b│ \u001b[94mGPIO5\u001b[m \u001b[8b│ Active-high (\u001b[94mGPIO -> 220..330 Ω -> Anode\u001b[m, Cathode to \u001b[94mGND\u001b[m)\r\n   \u001b[1mBar LED 2\u001b[m (≥ 28%) \u001b[9b│ \u001b[1mD4\u001b[m \u001b[7b│ \u001b[94mGPIO6\u001b[m \u001b[8b│ Active-high\r\n   \u001b[1mBar LED 3\u001b[m (≥ 43%) \u001b[9b│ \u001b[1mD5\u001b[m \u001b[7b│ \u001b[94mGPIO7\u001b[m \u001b[8b│ Active-high\r\n   \u001b[1mBar LED 4\u001b[m (≥ 57%) \u001b[9b│ \u001b[1mD6\u001b[m \u001b[7b│ \u001b[94mGPIO0\u001b[m \u001b[8b│ Active-high\r\n   \u001b[1mBar LED 5\u001b[m (≥ 71%) \u001b[9b│ \u001b[1mD7\u001b[m \u001b[7b│ \u001b[94mGPIO1\u001b[m \u001b[8b│ Active-high\r\n   \u001b[1mBar LED 6\u001b[m (highest, ≥ 86%) │ \u001b[1mD8\u001b[m \u001b[7b│ \u001b[94mGPIO2\u001b[m \u001b[8b│ Active-high\r\n   \u001b[1mOnboard Status LED\u001b[m \u001b[8b│ \u001b[3m(Onboard)\u001b[m │ \u001b[94mGPIO25\u001b[m \u001b[7b│ Active-low yellow user LED (driven by NuttX \u001b[94mARCH_LEDS\u001b[m)\r\n  ──────\r\n  \u001b[1m### Arc"]
[0.0, "o", "hitecture & Key Files\u001b[m\r\n\n  • \u001b[1mOut-of-Tree Build & Test Driver\u001b[m:\n\u001b[30D• \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk83b4f8209619fb66;file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-vanilla/xiao-rp2350-bargraph/Makefile\u0007xiao-rp2350-bargraph/Makefile\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007: Runs host unit tests (\u001b[94mmake -C xiao-rp2350-bargraph test\u001b[m) and builds the NuttX\r\n\u001b[6CUF2 firmware (\u001b[94mmake -C xiao-rp2350-bargraph\u001b[m) into \u001b[94mnuttx/nuttx.uf2\u001b[m using \u001b[94mCONFIG_ARCH_BOARD_CUSTOM\u001b[m and the\r\n\u001b[6Cgitignored \u001b[94mapps/external\u001b[m symlink so \u001b[94mnuttx/\u001b[m and \u001b[94mapps/\u001b[m remain untouched.\n\u001b[70D• \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk907b154d576011b0;file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-vanilla/xiao-rp2350-bargraph/README.md\u0007xiao-rp2350-bargraph/README.md\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007: Wiring diagram, build instructions, and NSH command reference.\r\n  • \u001b[1mPure Bar-Graph Logic & Host Unit Tests\u001b[m:\n\u001b[37D• \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jke28545727e0da6a9;file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-vanilla/xiao-rp2350-bargraph/include/bargraph_logic.h\u0007xiao-rp2350-bargraph/include/barg"]
[0.0, "o", "raph_logic.h\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 & \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk7ec651f17788c5bd;file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-vanilla/xiao-rp2350-bargraph/src/bargraph_logic.c\u0007xiao-rp2350-bargraph/src/bargraph_logic.c\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007: Decodes RP2350\r\n\u001b[6Cleft-shifted 12-bit ADC samples (\u001b[94msample >> 19\u001b[m), applies exponential moving average (EMA) smoothing (α = 1/4)\r\n\u001b[6Cand hysteresis deadband filtering (±48 counts), maps \u001b[94m0..4095\u001b[m into \u001b[94m0..6\u001b[m LEDs (\u001b[94m0x00..0x3f\u001b[m bitmask), and formats\r\n\u001b[6CASCII stat\r\n\n⣟  \u001b[90mGenerating...\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[94m>\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[90m───────────────────────────────────"]
[0.0, "o", "─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[90mesc to cancel\u001b[m\u001b[77X\u001b[77C\u001b[33mauto\u001b[39;2m · Gemini 4 Argon · medium\u001b[m\r\u001b[2A\u001b[2C\u001b[?2026l"]
[0.016, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[33A\t\t \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jke15dca09a24bd642;file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-vanilla/xiao-rp2350-bargraph/README.md\u0007xiao-rp2350-bargraph/\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007\r\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\t\u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkfdeb8e2a7d8e69fa;file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-vanilla/xiao-rp2350-bargraph/Makefile\u0007xiao-rp2350-bargraph/Makefile\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007\r\n\n\n\t\u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jke15dc809a24bd2dc;file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-vanilla/xiao-rp2350-bargraph/README.md\u0007xiao-rp2350-bargraph/README.md\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007\r\n\n\t\u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jka9dcc6b98f4d5e6d;file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-vanilla/xiao-rp2350-bargraph/include/bargraph_logic.h\u0007xiao-rp2350-bargraph/include/bargraph_logic.h\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 & \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jke2e4098b1b3153b9;file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-vanilla/xiao-rp2350-bargraph/src/bargraph_logic.c\u0007xiao-rp2350-bargraph/src/bargraph_logic.c\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007\r\n\n\n\t\tus output.\n\n\n\n\u001b[24D\u001b[?2026l"]
[0.017, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\r\u001b[33A  implemented in \u001b]8;id=jk8edbb637d12396f0;file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-vanilla/xiao-rp2350-bargraph/README.md\u001b\\\u001b[4;34;4mx\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mi\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4ma\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mo\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4m-\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mr\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mp\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4m2\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4m3\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4m5\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4m0\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4m-\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mb\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4ma\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mr\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mg\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mr\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4ma\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mp\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mh\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4m/\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u001b\\.\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[?5W\u001b[J\n  \u001b[1m### Breadboard Pinout (Seeed Studio XIAO RP2350)\u001b[m\r\n\n  All 6 bar-graph LEDs are placed on non-ADC digital pins (\u001b[94mD3\u001b[m–\u001b[94mD8\u001b[m) because \u001b[94mrp23xx_adc.c\u001b[m resets \u001b[94mGPIO26\u001b[m–\u001b[94mGPIO29\u001b[m (\u001b[94mD0\u001b[m–\u001b[94mD2\u001b[m)\r\n  to analog mode (\u001b[94mRP23XX_GPIO_FUNC_NULL\u001b[m) when initializing the ADC peripheral:\r\n\n   Function\u001b[19X\u001b[19C│ XIAO Pad  │ RP2350 GPIO   │ Active Polarity / Notes\r\n  ────────────────────────────┼───────────┼───────────────┼"]
[0.0, "o", "──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\r\n   \u001b[1mPotentiometer Wiper\u001b[m \u001b[7b│ \u001b[1mD0 / A0\u001b[m   │ \u001b[94mGPIO26\u001b[m (\u001b[94mADC0\u001b[m) │ \u001b[94m0 V\u001b[m (\u001b[94mGND\u001b[m) to \u001b[94m3.3 V\u001b[m (\u001b[94m3V3\u001b[m), read via \u001b[94m/dev/adc0\u001b[m\r\n   \u001b[1mBar LED 1\u001b[m (lowest, ≥ 14%)  │ \u001b[1mD3\u001b[m \u001b[7b│ \u001b[94mGPIO5\u001b[m \u001b[8b│ Active-high (\u001b[94mGPIO -> 220..330 Ω -> Anode\u001b[m, Cathode to \u001b[94mGND\u001b[m)\r\n   \u001b[1mBar LED 2\u001b[m (≥ 28%) \u001b[9b│ \u001b[1mD4\u001b[m \u001b[7b│ \u001b[94mGPIO6\u001b[m \u001b[8b│ Active-high\r\n   \u001b[1mBar LED 3\u001b[m (≥ 43%) \u001b[9b│ \u001b[1mD5\u001b[m \u001b[7b│ \u001b[94mGPIO7\u001b[m \u001b[8b│ Active-high\r\n   \u001b[1mBar LED 4\u001b[m (≥ 57%) \u001b[9b│ \u001b[1mD6\u001b[m \u001b[7b│ \u001b[94mGPIO0\u001b[m \u001b[8b│ Active-high\r\n   \u001b[1mBar LED 5\u001b[m (≥ 71%) \u001b[9b│ \u001b[1mD7\u001b[m \u001b[7b│ \u001b[94mGPIO1\u001b[m \u001b[8b│ Active-high\r\n   \u001b[1mBar LED 6\u001b[m (highest, ≥ 86%) │ \u001b[1mD8\u001b[m \u001b[7b│ \u001b[94mGPIO2\u001b[m \u001b[8b│ Active-high\r\n   \u001b[1mOnboard Status LED\u001b[m \u001b[8b│ \u001b[3m(Onboard)\u001b"]
[0.0, "o", "[m │ \u001b[94mGPIO25\u001b[m \u001b[7b│ Active-low yellow user LED (driven by NuttX \u001b[94mARCH_LEDS\u001b[m)\r\n  ──────\r\n  \u001b[1m### Architecture & Key Files\u001b[m\r\n\n  • \u001b[1mOut-of-Tree Build & Test Driver\u001b[m:\n\u001b[30D• \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkfd488baf2cd74ab0;file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-vanilla/xiao-rp2350-bargraph/Makefile\u0007xiao-rp2350-bargraph/Makefile\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007: Runs host unit tests (\u001b[94mmake -C xiao-rp2350-bargraph test\u001b[m) and builds the NuttX\r\n\u001b[6CUF2 firmware (\u001b[94mmake -C xiao-rp2350-bargraph\u001b[m) into \u001b[94mnuttx/nuttx.uf2\u001b[m using \u001b[94mCONFIG_ARCH_BOARD_CUSTOM\u001b[m and the\r\n\u001b[6Cgitignored \u001b[94mapps/external\u001b[m symlink so \u001b[94mnuttx/\u001b[m and \u001b[94mapps/\u001b[m remain untouched.\n\u001b[70D• \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk8edbb837d1239a56;file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-vanilla/xiao-rp2350-bargraph/README.md\u0007xiao-rp2350-bargraph/README.md\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007: Wiring diagram, build instructions, and NSH command reference.\r\n  • \u001b[1mPure Bar-Graph Logic & Host Unit Tests\u001b[m:\n\u001b[37D• \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jke95df2758b4f74d7;file:/"]
