[0.0, "o", "iring diagram, build instructions, and NSH command reference.\r\n  • \u001b[1mPure Bar-Graph Logic & Host Unit Tests\u001b[m:\n\u001b[37D• \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk81b904ff8814ead3;file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-vanilla/xiao-rp2350-bargraph/include/bargraph_logic.h\u0007xiao-rp2350-bargraph/include/bargraph_logic.h\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 & \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkec9e3cb329abc26f;file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-vanilla/xiao-rp2350-bargraph/src/bargraph_logic.c\u0007xiao-rp2350-bargraph/src/bargraph_logic.c\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007: Decodes RP2350\r\n\u001b[6Cleft-shifted 12-bit ADC samples (\u001b[94msample >> 19\u001b[m), applies exponential moving average (EMA) smoothing (α = 1/4)\r\n\u001b[6Cand hysteresis deadband filtering (±48 counts), maps \u001b[94m0..4095\u001b[m into \u001b[94m0..6\u001b[m LEDs (\u001b[94m0x00..0x3f\u001b[m bitmask), and formats\r\n\u001b[6CASCII status output.\n\u001b[20D• \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk650cdb212e9a3d9f;file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-vanilla/xiao-rp2350-bargraph/tests/test_bargraph.c\u0007xiao-rp2350-bargraph/tests/test_bargraph.c\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007: Host unit tests verifying "]
[0.0, "o", "ADC decoding, threshold edges,\r\n\u001b[6Chysteresis stability, and full-range sweeps.\r\n  • \u001b[1mOut-of-Tree NuttX Application (\u001b[94;22mbargraph\u001b[39;1m)\u001b[m:\n\u001b[39D• \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk677cbed42b95a0d8;file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-vanilla/xiao-rp2350-bargraph/apps/bargraph/bargraph_main.c\u0007xiao-rp2350-bargraph/apps/bargraph/bargraph_main.c\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007: Implements \u001b[94mbargraph_autostart()\u001b[m (spawning the \u001b[94mbargraph_d\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[6Cdaemon task that polls \u001b[94m/dev/adc0\u001b[m every 25 ms and updates \u001b[94m/dev/userleds\u001b[m via \u001b[94mULEDIOC_SETALL\u001b[m) and the interactive\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94mbargraph [start|status|once|stop]\u001b[m NSH command.\r\n  • \u001b[1mCustom XIAO RP2350 Board Configuration\u001b[m:\n\u001b[37D• \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkf0406fcd712ec75c;file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-vanilla/xiao-rp2350-bargraph/board/include/board.h\u0007xiao-rp2350-bargraph/board/include/board.h\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 & \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk9a584c6519ea44af;file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-vanilla/xiao-rp2350-bargraph/board/src/rp23xx_userleds.c\u0007xi"]
[0.0, "o", "ao-rp2350-bargraph/board/src/rp23xx_userleds.c\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007: Defines the 6\r\n\u001b[6Cbreadboard LED pins (\u001b[94mD3\u001b[m–\u001b[94mD8\u001b[m) for \u001b[94m/dev/userleds\u001b[m.\n\u001b[46D• \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk1822929942315f01;file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-vanilla/xiao-rp2350-bargraph/board/src/rp23xx_bringup.c\u0007xiao-rp2350-bargraph/board/src/rp23xx_bringup.c\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 & \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jked88abd08a066c9a;file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-vanilla/xiao-rp2350-bargraph/board/src/rp23xx_romfs.c\u0007xiao-rp2350-bargraph/board/src/rp23xx_romfs.c\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007: Registers\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94m/dev/adc0\u001b[m (\u001b[94mADC0\u001b[m on \u001b[94mGPIO26\u001b[m), \u001b[94m/dev/userleds\u001b[m, and \u001b[94m/etc/init.d/rcS\u001b[m, and starts the \u001b[94mbargraph_d\u001b[m background daemon\r\n\u001b[6Cimmediately at boot before USB CDC-ACM serial attaches (\u001b[94m# CONFIG_DEV_CONSOLE is not set\u001b[m +\n\u001b[89D\u001b[94mCONFIG_NSH_USBCONSOLE=y\u001b[m).\n\u001b[25D• \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk5efe8dbed544acd5;file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-vanilla/xiao-rp2350-bargraph/board/configs/bargraph/defconfig\u0007xiao-rp2350-ba"]
