[0.0, "o", "────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[34;1m> Please generate a breadboard wiring description for the circuit matching the firmware.\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[34;1m  Provide both a Markdown file with a parts list and wiring description, and a matching SVG diagramming the breadboard\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[2C\u001b[34;1mcircuit.\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[37m○\u001b[m \u001b[37mThought for 3m 44s\u001b[m \u001b[37m(Verifying the standard pin arrangement for the XIAO RP2350 14-pin header from a top-down view...)\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[32m●\u001b[m \u001b[33;1mExplored\u001b[m 2 files \u001b[37m(README.md, board.h)\u001b[m\u001b[K\n\u001b[36D\u001b[33;1mdited\u001b[m 3 files \u001b[37m(breadboard_circuit.svg, BREADBOARD_WIRING.md, README.md)"]
[0.0, "o", "\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[31m●\u001b[m \u001b[33;1mRan\u001b[m \u001b[37m(xmllint --noout /Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-vanilla/xiao-rp2350-bargraph/breadboard_circ...)\u001b[m \u001b[37mfailed\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[32m●\u001b[m \u001b[33;1mEdited\u001b[m 1 file \u001b[37m(breadboard_circuit.svg)\u001b[m\u001b[K\n\u001b[38D\u001b[33;1mRan\u001b[m \u001b[37m(xmllint --noout /Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-vanilla/xiao-rp2350-bargraph/b...)\u001b[m \u001b[37m(ctrl+o to expand)\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[K\n  Both the breadboard wiring documentation and the matching SVG circuit diagram have been generated in \u001b[94mxiao-rp2350-\u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[94mbargraph/\u001b[m:\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n  1. \u001b[1mBreadboard Wiring Guide & Parts List\u001b[m: \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk6bf4a94ce7b5e15b;file"]
